WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.410
This is the cup.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.470
Everyone loves the cup.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.090
The cup is approved.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.730
Then someone says: a little brighter?

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.160
And the cup is gone.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:22.130
Imagen Studio starts with the brief: four by three, room for a headline, no text in the picture.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.110
You pick from real drafts.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.330
And every change happens to the cup you picked.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:31.230
Brighter.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.030
Warmer.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.290
Same cup.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:40.370
It ships with its size, alt text, and family tree.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.850
And if it can’t see the pixels, it says so.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:58.090
Imagen Studio.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:01.240
Take the image from brief to chosen file.
